      "wtp": "3: paid comparables US$15-120/yr exist, but strong free options",
      "recurring": "4: annual by design; renewal is the risk",
      "build": "3: accounts, sharing, RLS, cron emails and Stripe webhook in one app",
      "maint": "3: yearly AU date data (terms, tax dates, fees) and email deliverability",
      "distro": "3: no built-in channel; free SEO feeders, seasonal peaks (Christmas, school holidays, EOFY) and parents' groups",
      "compete": "3: no AU paid bundle focused on dates-not-documents; free all-in-ones exist (Life Admin AI, TrackEase)",
      "defend": "4: switching cost grows with every date stored; household sharing",
      "synergy": "5: every module reuses one dates engine",
      "platform": "5: web app, no app-store gate",
      "aibuild": "3: RLS + webhooks + cron are where AI-built apps break (CVE-2025-48757)"
    },
    "notes": "Scored as a whole on rubric v2.0 (not in the idea shortlist). Recommended: freemium hybrid (free no-login tools -> one paid annual Pass)."
